#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials for official Qiskit Addons — circuit cutting, sample-based quantum diagonalization, operator backpropagation, and more."
msgstr "Tutorial untuk Qiskit Addons resmi — pemotongan Circuit, diagonalisasi kuantum berbasis sampel, backpropagation operator, dan lainnya."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques. Each addon focuses on a specific area and includes tutorials with executable code.\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) adalah paket ekstensi resmi yang menyediakan algoritma dan teknik komputasi kuantum yang terspesialisasi. Setiap addon berfokus pada area tertentu dan dilengkapi tutorial dengan kode yang bisa dijalankan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Addons {#available-addons}"
msgstr "Addon yang Tersedia {#available-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width and depth by cutting gates and wires |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization for ground state estimation |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation to reduce circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas for improved Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation with tensor networks |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption for error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones for reducing PEC sampling overhead |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Paket | Deskripsi |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Kurangi lebar dan kedalaman Circuit dengan memotong gate dan wire |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization untuk estimasi ground state |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation untuk mengurangi kedalaman Circuit |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas untuk simulasi Hamiltonian yang lebih baik |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation dengan tensor network |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption untuk mitigasi error |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones untuk mengurangi overhead sampling PEC |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All tutorials can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "Semua tutorial bisa dijalankan langsung di browser menggunakan Binder, atau di server Jupyter milikmu sendiri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For API documentation, visit the individual addon repos on [GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
msgstr "Untuk dokumentasi API, kunjungi repo addon masing-masing di [GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
